# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Finally, you can analyze the data. Here you will retrieve the job results, extract the measured expectation values from them, and plot the values, including error bars of one standard deviation.\n"
msgstr "Akhir sekali, anda boleh menganalisis data. Di sini anda akan mendapatkan semula keputusan kerja, mengekstrak nilai jangkaan yang diukur daripadanya, dan memplot nilai tersebut, termasuk bar ralat satu sisihan piawai.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/combine-error-mitigation-techniques/extracted-outputs/eef38976-0ca2-429a-b2dc-41aac69605f7-0.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/combine-error-mitigation-techniques/extracted-outputs/eef38976-0ca2-429a-b2dc-41aac69605f7-0.avif)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "At this small scale, it is difficult to see the effect of most of the error mitigation techniques, but zero-noise extrapolation does give a noticeable improvement. However, note that this improvement does not come for free, because the ZNE result also has a larger error bar.\n"
msgstr "Pada skala kecil ini, sukar untuk melihat kesan kebanyakan teknik mitigasi ralat, tetapi zero-noise extrapolation memang memberikan penambahbaikan yang ketara. Walau bagaimanapun, perlu diingat bahawa penambahbaikan ini tidak percuma, kerana keputusan ZNE juga mempunyai bar ralat yang lebih besar.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Large-scale hardware example {#large-scale-hardware-example}"
msgstr "Contoh perkakasan berskala besar {#large-scale-hardware-example}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "When developing an experiment, it's useful to start with a small circuit to make visualizations and simulations easier. Now that you've developed and tested our workflow on a 10-qubit circuit, you can scale it up to 50 qubits. The following code cell repeats all of the steps in this walkthrough, but now applies them to a 50-qubit circuit.\n"
msgstr "Semasa membangunkan eksperimen, berguna untuk bermula dengan Circuit kecil bagi memudahkan visualisasi dan simulasi. Setelah anda membangunkan dan menguji aliran kerja pada Circuit 10-Qubit, anda boleh skala naik kepada 50 qubit. Sel kod berikut mengulangi semua langkah dalam panduan ini, tetapi kini mengaplikasikannya kepada Circuit 50-Qubit.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/combine-error-mitigation-techniques/extracted-outputs/d7d8408b-faf1-4eda-ab9c-bdeaab01ff53-0.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/combine-error-mitigation-techniques/extracted-outputs/d7d8408b-faf1-4eda-ab9c-bdeaab01ff53-0.avif)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "When you compare the 50-qubit results with the 10-qubit results from earlier, you might note the following (your results might differ across runs):\n"
msgstr "Apabila anda membandingkan keputusan 50-Qubit dengan keputusan 10-Qubit tadi, anda mungkin perhatikan perkara berikut (keputusan anda mungkin berbeza antara larian):\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "All experiments give results closer to the ideal value and all the error bars are smaller.\n"
msgstr "Semua eksperimen memberikan keputusan yang lebih hampir kepada nilai ideal dan semua bar ralat adalah lebih kecil.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The addition of dynamical decoupling might have worsened performance compared to the no-mitigation case. This is not surprising, because the circuit is very dense. Dynamical decoupling is primarily useful when there are large gaps in the circuit, during which qubits sit idle without gates being applied to them. When these gaps are not present, dynamical decoupling is not effective, and can actually worsen performance due to errors in the dynamical decoupling pulses themselves. The 10-qubit circuit may have been too small for us to observe this effect.\n"
msgstr "Penambahan dynamical decoupling mungkin telah memperburukkan prestasi berbanding kes tanpa mitigasi. Ini tidak menghairankan, kerana Circuit ini sangat padat. Dynamical decoupling terutamanya berguna apabila terdapat jurang besar dalam Circuit, semasa qubit duduk melahu tanpa gate diaplikasikan kepadanya. Apabila jurang ini tidak wujud, dynamical decoupling tidak berkesan, malah boleh memperburukkan prestasi akibat ralat dalam nadi dynamical decoupling itu sendiri. Circuit 10-Qubit mungkin terlalu kecil untuk kita perhatikan kesan ini.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "With zero-noise extrapolation, the result is very close to the ideal value. This demonstrates the power of ZNE.\n"
msgstr "Dengan zero-noise extrapolation, hasilnya sangat hampir dengan nilai ideal. Ini menunjukkan kehebatan ZNE.\n"

